{"id":"en_turning-my-life-around-after-marrying-a-fool","title":"Turning My Life Around After Marrying a Fool","titleEn":"Turning My Life Around After Marrying a Fool","description":"Emma Carter grew up poor after losing her father young, raised by her struggling mother Joanne together with her sister Natalie. An old engagement bound one of the daughters to marry the mayor's slow-witted son, and when a lot-drawing was held to settle the matter, Joanne allowed Natalie to cheat, pushing Emma into a hopeless marriage instead. Emma later disappeared while working away from home with her husband, and a guilt-ridden Joanne set out to find her. Natalie, meanwhile, went to college and turned into a gold-digger who resented her mother and her origins. On the day Natalie became engaged to a wealthy heir, Emma and Joanne returned and exposed her true nature, and Natalie finally paid the price for her hypocrisy.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/turning-my-life-around-after-marrying-a-fool/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/turning-my-life-around-after-marrying-a-fool/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Family Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dmqg8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_turning-my-life-around-after-marrying-a-fool_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dmqg8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_turning-my-life-around-after-marrying-a-fool_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dmqg8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_turning-my-life-around-after-marrying-a-fool_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"